is Item 1A:","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors.","block":394,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001274737-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-10","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001274737","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1274737/000127473726000009/exdx-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/3cc8854c4453f1b25ff224b51ebe08cde468b2958b7b2186c6157a7da0e735b8.bin","sha256":"3cc8854c4453f1b25ff224b51ebe08cde468b2958b7b2186c6157a7da0e735b8"}},{"id":"9f2aeabd5ac9ca59398abddf2622be2556309a23ad9dd2ac1f3b3bbf225e72cb","quote":"•If third-party payors do not provide coverage and adequate reimbursement for our testing products, or they breach, rescind or modify their contracts or reimbursement policies or delay payments for our testing products, or if we or our partners are unable to successfully negotiate payor contracts, our commercial success could be materially compromised;","context":"•Our operating results may fluctuate significantly, which makes our future operating results difficult to predict and could cause our operating results to fall below expectations or any guidance we may provide. We have a history of losses and we may not be able to generate sufficient revenue to achieve and maintain profitability. Our estimates regarding profitability and the time in which we may achieve profitability may ultimately be incorrect;","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors.","block":395,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001274737-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-10","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001274737","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1274737/000127473726000009/exdx-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/3cc8854c4453f1b25ff224b51ebe08cde468b2958b7b2186c6157a7da0e735b8.bin","sha256":"3cc8854c4453f1b25ff224b51ebe08cde468b2958b7b2186c6157a7da0e735b8"}},{"id":"960c1556762a117383800f93a95c005f60a28eea0bd15e9532153db21bdd52ea","quote":"•In the near-term, we expect that our financial results will depend primarily on sales of our testing products, and we will need to generate sufficient revenue from these testing products to grow our business;","context":"•If third-party payors do not provide coverage and adequate reimbursement for our testing products, or they breach, rescind or modify their contracts or reimbursement policies or delay payments for our testing products, or if we or our partners are unable to successfully negotiate payor contracts, our commercial success could be materially compromised;","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors.","block":396,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001274737-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-10","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001274737","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1274737/000127473726000009/exdx-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/3cc8854c4453f1b25ff224b51ebe08cde468b2958b7b2186c6157a7da0e735b8.bin","sha256":"3cc8854c4453f1b25ff224b51ebe08cde468b2958b7b2186c6157a7da0e735b8"}},{"id":"dbf7be1fc1a4d2436e9942e0bedaa37ff7442e37a2a9a4a4826761e8d1378cf5","quote":"•We may be unable to manage our growth effectively, which could make it difficult to execute our business strategy;","context":"•In the near-term, we expect that our financial results will depend primarily on sales of our testing products, and we will need to generate sufficient revenue from these testing products to grow our business;","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors.","block":397,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001274737-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-10","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001274737","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1274737/000127473726000009/exdx-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/3cc8854c4453f1b25ff224b51ebe08cde468b2958b7b2186c6157a7da0e735b8.bin","sha256":"3cc8854c4453f1b25ff224b51ebe08cde468b2958b7b2186c6157a7da0e735b8"}},{"id":"25a6947a029b3e22e4be7a739b8f53a59c6928dff610fc9d3518a4dcaa939240","quote":"•Our commercial success depends on attaining and maintaining significant market acceptance of our testing products among rheumatologists, patients, third-party payors and others in the medical community;","context":"•We may be unable to manage our growth effectively, which could make it difficult to execute our business strategy;","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors.","block":398,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001274737-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-10","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001274737","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1274737/000127473726000009/exdx-20251231.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/3cc8854c4453f1b25ff224b51ebe08cde468b2958b7b2186c6157a7da0e735b8.bin","sha256":"3cc8854c4453f1b25ff224b51ebe08cde468b2958b7b2186c6157a7da0e735b8"}},{"id":"6cc583d6779579ca81fc053c1871a0c0fb1111ad1f4c1fe7191a15416ad9c490","quote":"•We rely on sole suppliers for some of the reagents, equipment and other materials used in our testing products, and we may not be able to fund replacements or transition to alternative suppliers;","context":"•Our commercial success depends on attaining and maintaining significant market acceptance of our testing products among rheumatologists, patients, third-party payors and others in the medical community;","section":"Item 1A. Risk Factors.","block":399,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001274737-26-000009","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-10","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001274737","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1274737/000127473726000009/exdx-20251231.htm","rawPath":